    {
      "id": "18384883120235182",
      "caption": "ALC 2022- A big ol' gratitude to all the donors who contributed to my ALC campaign this year! The ride was fantastic the work you all supported from the @sfaidsfound and lalgbtcenter is even fantastic-er. The ride started almost 30 years ago. There were participants who needed blood transfusions at the end of each day because they were so sick with AIDS. We've come so far thanks to the movement this ride represents. But there's work to be done. People still die from HIV/AIDS every day. I hope you'll join me in enlisting for the cause. Ride safe. Be safe.",
